# PLANTER HOP: ollie over a Dolores Park planter: here its north-east corner, from the grass north
# of it to the sidewalk east (the trees in the middle of the planters stop a straight hop across).
# The air passes over the planter's outline with both ends outside it.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -240.8 -164.9 8.86 137
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 2.7280
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y -2.9254
hold ollie 101..131
run 330
expect event pop within 130..134
expect event land{quality=clean} within 245..249
expect event gap{id=planter_hop,gap=PLANTER HOP,points=300} within 245..249
expect skater.pos.x > -236.7 at 247
expect no event bail
